# C# and .NET Software Development Portfolio

## Overview

This repository contains projects completed during my C# and .NET Software Development training. Throughout this course, I developed applications using C#, Object-Oriented Programming principles, Entity Framework, SQL Server, and ASP.NET MVC.

These projects demonstrate my ability to design, develop, debug, and deploy software solutions using Microsoft technologies.

