# Projects

## Student Database Application (Entity Framework Code First)

### Description

Created a Code First console application using Entity Framework that automatically generates a SQL database and stores student information.

### Features

* Code First Development
* Automatic Database Creation
* Student Record Management
* SQL Server Integration

### Technologies Used

* C#
* Entity Framework 6
* SQL Server
* Visual Studio 2022

---

## Car Insurance ASP.NET MVC Application

### Description

Developed an ASP.NET MVC web application that calculates insurance quotes based on customer information and stores records in a database.

### Features

* User Input Forms
* Insurance Quote Calculations
* Database Storage
* Administrative View for Quotes
* Entity Framework Integration

### Technologies Used

* ASP.NET MVC
* C#
* Entity Framework
* SQL Server
* HTML
* CSS

